em that I came across on release day. I thought it was going to be one of those games that I picked up for a few days and then put down, but to my surprise I am still playing to this day. \n\nas frustrating as the very luck based and RNG heavy game mechanics are, it just makes the game all the more satisfying to get a good run in. With friends, this game becomes challenging with scaling, but it makes you work harder. Learning how items synergize, stages are nuanced, and how deadly certain enemies are is INTEGRAL to getting a good run. (and oftentimes bowing a little harder to RNJesus)\n\nOverall I would absolutely recommend this game to anyone who likes fast paced action, split second decision making, and getting one shot by little firey boys.", "timestamp_created": 1619130743, "timestamp_updated": 1728957207, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}]}